{"slug":"461834-eega-yaake","title":"ಈಗ ಯಾಕೆ?","titleEn":"Eega Yaake","level":"1","description":"","orientation":"landscape","cover":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/461834-eega-yaake/cover.jpg","width":548,"height":549},"audio":null,"provenance":{"source":"https://storyweaver.org.in/en/stories/461834-eega-yaake","license":"CC-BY-4.0","licenseNote":"Fetched from StoryWeaver's public API; the book's own attribution page states 'Released under CC BY 4.0 license' for the story and each illustration. Text is the page HTML with markup removed; illustrations are StoryWeaver's 700–960 px crops, unmodified apart from JPEG re-encoding; audio re-encoded to mono MP3.","storyweaverId":461834,"authors":["Madhuri Purandare"],"illustrators":["Madhuri Purandare"],"translators":["Hema Khurshapur"],"publisher":"Pratham Books","publishedYear":"2022","originalStory":{"title":"आता का?"},"copyrightNotice":"‘Eega Yaake?’ has been published on StoryWeaver by Pratham Books. www.prathambooks.org.","attributionLine":"ಈಗ ಯಾಕೆ? (Kannada), translated by Hema Khurshapur, based on original story आता का?, written by Madhuri Purandare, illustrated by Madhuri Purandare, published by Pratham Books (© Pratham Books, 2022) under a CC BY 4.0 license on StoryWeaver. Read, create and translate stories for free on www.storyweaver.org.in","imageCredits":[{"page":2,"title":"Son mouse dragging duppatta of his mom","illustrator":"Madhuri Purandare","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2021"},{"page":3,"title":"Son mouse pointing out toys","illustrator":"Madhuri Purandare","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2021"},{"page":4,"title":"Mom mouse cooking","illustrator":"Madhuri Purandare","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2021"},{"page":5,"title":"Son mouse crying","illustrator":"Madhuri Purandare","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2021"},{"page":6,"title":"Baby mouse crying and laying on ground","illustrator":"Madhuri Purandare","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2021"},{"page":7,"title":"Mom mouse serching on something","illustrator":"Madhuri Purandare","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2021"},{"page":8,"title":"Son mouse talking on a cell phone","illustrator":"Madhuri Purandare","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2021"},{"page":9,"title":"Son mouse pointing out toys while holding celll phone","illustrator":"Madhuri Purandare","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2021"},{"page":10,"title":"Mom mouse carrying plate and cup","illustrator":"Madhuri Purandare","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2021"},{"page":11,"title":"Son mouse hugging mom","illustrator":"Madhuri Purandare","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2021"},{"page":12,"title":"Son mouse feeding mom","illustrator":"Madhuri Purandare","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2021"},{"page":13,"title":"Mouses taking picture","illustrator":"Madhuri Purandare","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2021"}],"retrieved":"2026-09-25"},"pages":[{"n":1,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/461834-eega-yaake/p01.jpg","width":2232,"height":2406},"text":["“ಅಮ್ಮಾ! ನನಗೆ ವೇಫರ್ಸ್ ಬೇಕು...”","“ಬೇಡ ಮುನ್ನಾ, ಈಗ ಊಟ ಮಾಡೋಣ.”"]},{"n":2,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/461834-eega-yaake/p02.jpg","width":2232,"height":2406},"text":["“ಹಾಗಿದ್ರೆ, ಆಟಿಕೆ ಸಾಮಾನು ಕೊಡು.”","“ಬೇಡ! ಮತ್ತೆ ಎಲ್ಲ ಹರಡುವೆ.”"]},{"n":3,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/461834-eega-yaake/p03.jpg","width":2232,"height":2406},"text":["“ನಾನು ಸಾವಿಯ ಜೊತೆಗೆ ಆಡಲು ಹೋಗುವೆ.”","“ಬೇಡ!”"]},{"n":4,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/461834-eega-yaake/p04.jpg","width":2232,"height":2406},"text":["“ಏನ್ ಕೇಳಿದರೂ ಬೇಡ, ಬೇಡ.","ನಾನು ಅಂದ್ರೆ ನಿನಗೆ ಇಷ್ಟವಿಲ್ಲ.”"]},{"n":5,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/461834-eega-yaake/p05.jpg","width":2232,"height":2406},"text":["“ನೀನು ಅಂದ್ರೆ ನನಗೂ ಇಷ್ಟ ಇಲ್ಲ.”"]},{"n":6,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/461834-eega-yaake/p06.jpg","width":2232,"height":2406},"text":["“ಸರಿ. ಮುಂದೇನು?”","“ನಾನು ಅಪ್ಪನಿಗೆ ಹೇಳುತ್ತೇನೆ.”"]},{"n":7,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/461834-eega-yaake/p07.jpg","width":2232,"height":2406},"text":["“ಅಪ್ಪಾsss!! ನನಗೆ ಬೇರೆ ಅಮ್ಮ ಬೇಕು. ನಾನು ಕೇಳಿದ್ದಕ್ಕೆ ಹೂಂ ಅನ್ನುವ ಒಳ್ಳೆಯ ಅಮ್ಮ ಬೇಕು...”"]},{"n":8,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/461834-eega-yaake/p08.jpg","width":2232,"height":2406},"text":["“ನನಗೂ ಬೇರೆ ಮಗು ಬೇಕು.","ನಾನು ಹೇಳಿದಂತೆ ಕೇಳುವ,","ಜಾಣ ಮಗು ಬೇಕು.”"]},{"n":9,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/461834-eega-yaake/p09.jpg","width":2232,"height":2406},"text":["“ಏನೂssss?”"]},{"n":10,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/461834-eega-yaake/p10.jpg","width":2232,"height":2406},"text":["“ಈಗ ಯಾಕೆ?”"]},{"n":11,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/461834-eega-yaake/p11.jpg","width":2232,"height":2406},"text":["“ಅಮ್ಮಾ ಆsss ಮಾಡು.","ಈ ತುತ್ತು ನಿನಗೆ.”","“ನಾನು ಬೇಡ ಅನ್ನಲ್ಲ.”"]},{"n":12,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/461834-eega-yaake/p12.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":[]}],"wordCount":75}